001700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001800 MAIN-PARA.
001900     MOVE WS-PK TO ED-PK.
002000     MOVE WS-BIN TO ED-BIN.
002100     DISPLAY 'BEFORE [' WS-NAME ']['  WS-CH '][' WS-DIG ']'.
002200     DISPLAY 'BEFORE ' WS-NUM ' ' ED-PK ' ' ED-BIN.
002300     DISPLAY 'BEFORE [' WS-G1 '][' WS-G2 ']'.
