002500     MOVE SPACE  TO WS-CH.
002600     MOVE ZEROS  TO WS-DIG.
002700     MOVE ZERO   TO WS-NUM.
002800     MOVE ZEROS  TO WS-PK.
002900     MOVE ZERO   TO WS-BIN.
003000     MOVE SPACES TO WS-GRP.
003100     MOVE WS-PK TO ED-PK.
003200     MOVE WS-BIN TO ED-BIN.
003300     DISPLAY 'AFTER  [' WS-NAME ']['  WS-CH '][' WS-DIG ']'.
003400     DISPLAY 'AFTER  ' WS-NUM ' ' ED-PK ' ' ED-BIN.
